  "description": "Vivian, the daughter of Duke Karlsruhe, uses her influence to have her lover, the illegitimate fifth prince Alex, crowned emperor. But happiness soon turns to despair when Alex takes a mistress and has Vivian imprisoned. Driven to hopelessness, Vivian ends her life—only to awaken on the day of her wedding to Alex, this time with a burning thirst for revenge.\n\n(Source: Manta)",
